      "description": "<p>Diggen Thrune's ghost cannot leave the keep while Nashaxian still watches it. If Nashaxian is rendered unable to watch over him (such as if the PCs bind the devil to the keep), then Diggen can leave the keep. Still, his soul cannot pass on to the afterlife until he fulfills the terms of his contract.</p>",
